<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-2">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-500">
      Direct Comparison
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Traditional vs Smart Staircase Sensors</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">See why upgrading to LuminaStep is the smarter choice for your home.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <!-- Traditional Lighting -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Traditional Stair Lighting</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-500 bg-red-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Outdated</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          <span>Manual Wall Switch: Searching for switches in dark hallways leads to nighttime trip hazards.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          <span>All-Or-Nothing On: Turns on entire floor lighting, blinding family members at night.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          <span>High Power Consumption: Lights stay left on all night continuously wasting electricity.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          <span>Complex Splicing: Requires high-voltage AC wiring and professional electrician fees.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- LuminaStep Smart Sensors -->
    <div class="bg-gray-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-800">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-gray-800">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">LuminaStep™ PIR + Microwave Sensors</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30">Next-Gen Smart</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span>Automatic Step Cascade: Smooth sequential staircase illumination tracks your walk direction.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span>Daylight Photocell Sensor: Automatically turns off during daylight, saving 85% energy.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span>Heavy Duty 500W Support: Shortcutproof technology with up to 32 channel stair outputs.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span>Safe 12V/24V Low Voltage: Zero shock hazard, safe for children, pets, and senior citizens.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

